- hide ledger? Maybe hide ledger to fit: content = padding 5 + head 11 + grid 109 = 125. Crew at 480: stage 428 - 96 - 62 - 60 = 210, fits with ledger 50? 125+55=180, fits. So scene 96, crew 210, okay. We can set scene 112 at <=520. Hmm. At 480: stage 428, scene 112, cart 62, actions 60 => crew 194; content 125+55=180 fits. Good. So:
@media (max-height: 620px) { scene 168; cart 62; ...}
@media (max-height: 520px) { scene 112; }

